# but keep the README and any human-curated docs we put in data/
!data/README.md

# Source literature — scanned PDFs / archives of published reports.
# Not committed: ~177 MB, redistributable from the original publishers, and
# only the derived markdown in docs/intake_analyses/ is source-of-truth.
# See "Source literature archive" in data/README.md.
FOR GITHUB*.zip
data/literature/
# docs/USGS_assessment_methodology.pdf is deliberately tracked (1 MB, cited by
# docs/04 and the intake analyses). Any other large PDF belongs in
# data/literature/, not in git.

